{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddbe Giant Mechs \u00d7 Space Battles</h2>Pilot a humanoid mech and soar freely through outer space.<br>Engage enemies from every direction using full 3D tactical movement.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/gif2.gif?t=1749844765\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfaf Auto-Aim FPS for Instant Action</h2>Keep enemies centered on your screen to auto-lock and fire.<br>Master inertia-based movement to chase down fast-moving targets.<br>True piloting skill means mastering motion in zero gravity.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/gif11.gif?t=1749844765\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udca5 Slash, Shoot, Explode \u2014 Master Four Sub-Weapons</h2>Missiles, grenades, beam blades, and shields.<br>Switch weapons on the fly to control the battlefield.<br>Your mech is built for both close-quarters and long-range combat. Note: This title does not feature mech customization.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/gif4.gif?t=1749844765\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcd6 Simple Story, Snappy Missions</h2>You\u2019re a rookie pilot, thrown into a war for your homeland.<br>Join a rough-edged strike squad and survive the front lines.<br>A short sci-fi narrative connects each high-paced mission.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/gif5.gif?t=1749844765\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Coordinate Military Ops with Your Squad</h2>Follow your commander\u2019s orders and move fluidly through battle.<br>Support allied warships, defend key points, and adapt to a shifting battlefield.<br>Tactical awareness is key to survival.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/gif3.gif?t=1749844765\" /><br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3123770?t=1749844765","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/0b977c9e3e882b18d9bd2875c8955ba91169ef56/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749844765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/e1f68d00bb9dcc59953bbdfdc52d3586f3e38d1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749844765","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/e1f68d00bb9dcc59953bbdfdc52d3586f3e38d1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749844765","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddbe Giant Mechs \u00d7 Space Battles</h2>Pilot a humanoid mech and soar freely through outer space.<br>Engage enemies from every direction using full 3D tactical movement.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/gif2.gif?t=1749844765\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfaf Auto-Aim FPS for Instant Action</h2>Keep enemies centered on your screen to auto-lock and fire.<br>Master inertia-based movement to chase down fast-moving targets.<br>True piloting skill means mastering motion in zero gravity.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/gif11.gif?t=1749844765\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udca5 Slash, Shoot, Explode